[[7,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Position the vehicle on the ramp.</p><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/2429258\">4450B04</a>\n                                           .</p><p>1. Undo the nut (1a) and disconnect the steering rod (1b) from the\nright front hub steering knuckle using the tool (1c).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1c</p></td><td><p>Extractor</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.871.000.700</p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Undo the bolts fixing the right front hub steering knuckle to\nthe front shock absorber.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2044581.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[8,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/2429258\">4450B04</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/2429681\">7055B66</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/2429684\">7055B91</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/2429139\">2710A31</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/2429131\">2110D62</a>\n                                           .</p>"],[7,1,0,"<p>1. Loosen the band (1a) and disconnect the right driveshaft (1b).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2044582.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[8,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/2429131\">2110D62</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/2429139\">2710A31</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/2429684\">7055B91</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/2429681\">7055B66</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/2429258\">4450B04</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Refill the manual gearbox and differential \n\n                                          <a href=\"#/2428826\">0010T40</a>\n                                           .</p>"],[7,1,0,"<p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/2429116\">2110D61</a>\n                                           .</p>"],[7,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/2429116\">2110D61</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Connect the right driveshaft and tighten\nthe band.</p><p>1. Tighten the bolts fixing the right front hub steering knuckle\nto the front shock absorber to the recommended torque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>FRONT HUB STEERING KNUCKLE.</p></td><td><p>M10</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>(Shock absorber side) 6.2 ÷ 6.8</p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Connect the steering rod (2a) to the right front steering knuckle\nand tighten the nut (2b) to the recommended torque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2b</p></td><td><p>Nut</p></td><td><p>ADJUSTABLE STEERING LINKS</p></td><td><p>M10</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>(Steering knuckle side) 3.6 ÷ 4.4</p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2044583.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[7,1,0,"<p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/2429258\">4450B04</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Refill the manual gearbox and differential \n\n                                          <a href=\"#/2428827\">0010T41</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Remove the car from the ramps.</p>"]]